<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000"><STRONG>Berlin</STRONG> subway's tv has written today that <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> will come to <STRONG>Berlin</STRONG> for the <STRONG>Echo Awards 2004</STRONG>, which will take place on March 6th. There's nothing official yet. <br><br><b>Note:</b> <i>Special thanks to <STRONG>FRENCHBERLINER</STRONG>. Published at 9:40pm w. Europe 
