<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000">From <STRONG>ICON WEBSITE</STRONG>:<BR>Thanks to all who entered the <STRONG>“Nobody Knows Me Collage”</STRONG> Contest. <BR>Alright! The submissions are in and the finalists have been chosen. The collages have all been posted. Check them out below and vote for the one you like best.<BR>Voting will be closed at Noon Eastern on Friday, February 20th.<BR>The three entries receiving the most votes will receive a copy of <STRONG>Nobody Knows Me</STRONG> autographed by <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> herself. 
</font></div>
