<table border="0" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="100%"><tr><td>
<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=6"><img src="images/topics/magazines.gif" border="0" Alt="Magazines" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000">Celebrity Makeup <STRONG>Artist Sharon Gault</STRONG> will be teaching an exclusive <STRONG>Technical Seminar</STRONG> on Sunday February 15 in <STRONG>New York City</STRONG>, at the <STRONG>Makeup Forever Store</STRONG>, 409 West Broadway, NY, NY 10012 from 6.00 -9.00 pm. She will be demonstrating the latest looks "hot off the Runway" from the <STRONG>Valentino Show</STRONG>, Fall 2004 using <STRONG>Makeup Forever Cosmetics</STRONG>. <BR><BR><STRONG>Sharon</STRONG> began her career as a hair colorist at the <STRONG>Vidal Sassoon Academy</STRONG>. Her flair for color and trends and fashion soon led her to a bright celebrity future in the makeup industry. She has worked on the <STRONG>Blonde Ambition tour</STRONG> with <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG>, and on music videos with many artists including <STRONG>Justin Timberlake</STRONG>, <STRONG>Blink 182</STRONG>, <STRONG>Mandy Moore</STRONG>, and recently <STRONG>Kelis</STRONG>. She works with 3 time <STRONG>MTV</STRONG> music video Director of the year, and acclaimed fashion photographer <STRONG>David La Chapelle</STRONG> on front covers for such magazines as <STRONG>I.D.</STRONG>, <STRONG>British Vogue</STRONG>, <STRONG>Flaunt</STRONG>, <STRONG>Vanity Fair</STRONG>... you name it! She's done it!<BR><BR>Last year she won <STRONG>"Best Makeup"</STRONG> at the <STRONG>MVPA Awards</STRONG> for the <STRONG>Christina Agueilera</STRONG>'s video <STRONG>"Dirrty"</STRONG>, and she continues to work non-stop with many young celebrity <STRONG>Hollywood</STRONG> actors and actresses. She is one of the top makeup artists in her field in the world, and continues to contribute to young and upcoming makeup artists with her tireless teaching. Many of her young students assist her backstage at <STRONG>LA</STRONG> and <STRONG>NY Fashion Weeks</STRONG>, photoshoots and music videos, giving them a real kick-start into the world of fashion and beauty.<BR><BR>She works as a Creative Director with Production Company <STRONG>StylezoneTV Productions</STRONG>, Inc. and together they produce her workshops, special events, photoshoots & technical seminars, internationally.<BR><BR><STRONG>StylezoneTV Productions</STRONG> is an independent TV production company specializing in press coverage of Fashion/Beauty & Style events such as <STRONG>The Oscars</STRONG>, <STRONG>LA Fashion Week</STRONG> and <STRONG>NY Fashion Week</STRONG> and reality programming. They also produce photoshoots and workshops for celebrity makeup artists, fashion stylists, and hairstylists in the <STRONG>U.S.A.</STRONG> and <STRONG>Europe</STRONG>.<BR><BR><STRONG>Sharon Gault</STRONG> - known as <STRONG>Mama Makeup</STRONG> is now launching her <STRONG>MamaMakeup</STRONG> teaching DVD's and exclusive makeup brush sets available for purchase through <STRONG>StylezoneTV.com</STRONG> and <STRONG>Beauty Launch Pad Magazine</STRONG>.<br><br><b>Note:</b> <i>Read it first here: Published at 12:10am W. Europe Standard Time. Source: 
<STRONG>eMediaWire</STRONG>.</i>

</font></div>
