<P><STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> said that she wouldn't be in <STRONG>London</STRONG> for <STRONG>Gwyneth Paltrow</STRONG>'s baby shower, because she will be in <STRONG>Los Angeles</STRONG>.</P>
